{"title":"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is a square and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> are the midpoints of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0948661e822f2a953c43a57ac9e40b2734476de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> respectively. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/1/d91371e2a1a282ace838a14073ffa067b23fd956.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin \\theta=$\" width=\"53\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/9/5492ba158043d653ed4090a75df79115e58fdb4f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,0)--(2,0)--(2,2)--(0,2)--cycle); draw((0,0)--(2,1)); draw((0,0)--(1,2)); label(&quot;A&quot;, (0,0), SW); label(&quot;B&quot;, (0,2), NW); label(&quot;C&quot;, (2,2), NE); label(&quot;D&quot;, (2,0), SE); label(&quot;M&quot;, (1,2), N); label(&quot;N&quot;, (2,1), E); label(&quot;$\\theta$&quot;, (.5,.5), SW); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"248\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/5/235d748380e60b70813e0d405c19ae16c2a41acd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{3}{5} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{5} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{4}{5}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"490\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Use the Sine Area Formula. We can isolate the triangle for which the angle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/e/52e8ed7a3ba22130ad3984eb2cd413406475a689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is contained in. WLOG, denote the side length of a triangle as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Our midpoints are then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Subtract the areas of the triangles that don't include the area of our desired triangle: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/b/8bb81ad427e901405b70c54efbf8e48b95450ced.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4-1-1-\\frac{1}{2} = \\frac{3}{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"148\" height=\"37\" /> The Sine Area Formula tells us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/4/ed4a500f4989917c3e1572321f113d7d2ad3d219.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}(\\sqrt{5})^2\\sin\\theta=\\frac{3}{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"137\" height=\"37\" /> Solving this equation, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/d/1ad3fe63c23b9f1f6e30142ab734d41906280e66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin\\theta=\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{3}{5} \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"104\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Solution: Everyoneintexas\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/1/f41f5e6b6d8f63fd83afa1e884e0f87458557c93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha = \\angle MAB = \\angle DAN$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"181\" height=\"14\" />, and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> be the side length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />.  Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/e/43e295ccadee8349582075a73863b4ddbe789eb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BM = \\frac{s}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"73\" height=\"34\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/3/5633ac7b6b6eeaa95c586c6105fd58e10c58ad26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AM = \\frac{s\\sqrt{5}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"96\" height=\"43\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/a/eba91130132e6c7527ecc6924f8b522c56d1bd70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin \\alpha = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"91\" height=\"43\" />.  Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/a/dba875cfe8a92ba83719a35d10e1295e64b02f5d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin \\theta = \\sin \\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2} - 2\\alpha \\right) = \\cos 2\\alpha = 1 - 2 \\sin^{2}\\alpha = 1 - 2\\cdot \\frac{1}{5} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{3}{5}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"523\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p><p>-j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME\" title=\"1987 AHSME\">1987 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1987 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1987\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017180000\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 176/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2494/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 152/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4460/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,ca